z0eQaqiZXbEhMOALk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7DCvISVdHabBPZxrbJkI_DGg7ninOHj-08nR5SoYkY-Q&oe=6A11CB33"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape_coverart.png", "id": "897861905346420", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982672_897861908679753_3996777238831042692_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gDc_S6ZL0PUQ7kNvwGY72eH&_nc_oc=AdpicHXYdwEbJC4vcSfjYZxEJT3RadbppsPTZ7V6wjoZU_hstwAMRVEBlWloRfF0eS0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5WfzSoZyz0puuQP-rp2cj8n6IBuDR-JkQI6fKSmpkU8w&oe=6A11CDAB"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets Escape", "keywords": ["puzzle", "escape", "room", "trivia", "brainteaser"], "long_description": "# AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "Crack awesome puzzles around many boxes, and discover the history of the world's most popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logoTransparent.png", "id":